@page "/contact"

<PageTitle>Contact - UPCSG</PageTitle>

<section class="upcsg-banner">
    <img class="upcsg-banner__crest" src="img/upcsg-crest.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
    <span class="upcsg-sparkle upcsg-sparkle--gold" style="top: 26%; right: 32%;"><span class="upcsg-star" style="width: 1rem; height: 1rem;"></span></span>
    <span class="upcsg-sparkle upcsg-sparkle--lilac upcsg-sparkle--delay-2" style="bottom: 30%; right: 44%;"><span class="upcsg-star" style="width: 0.65rem; height: 0.65rem;"></span></span>

    <div class="upcsg-banner__inner">
        <p class="upcsg-eyebrow"><span class="upcsg-star"></span> Reach the guild</p>
        <h1 class="upcsg-banner__title">Get in Touch</h1>
        <p class="upcsg-lede" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
            Questions about membership, events, or merch? Every channel below reaches the same
            set of officers &mdash; pick whichever you already have open.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="upcsg-page upcsg-page--after-hero">

    @* ---------- Channels ----------
       Three cards rather than a list, because the useful information isn't the handle —
       it's which one to pick. Each says what it's actually good for. *@
    <section class="upcsg-section">
        <div class="upcsg-section-head">
            <div>
                <p class="upcsg-kicker">Where to reach us</p>
                <h2 class="upcsg-title-xl">Pick a channel</h2>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="upcsg-cards">
            <a class="upcsg-surface upcsg-lift upcsg-card" href="https://facebook.com/upcsg"
               target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                <span class="upcsg-channel__icon">
                    <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Custom.Brands.Facebook" Size="Size.Medium" />
                </span>
                <span class="upcsg-card__tag">Facebook</span>
                <h3 class="upcsg-card__title">/UPCSG</h3>
                <p class="upcsg-card__meta">
                    Where announcements go up first. Best for anything time-sensitive &mdash;
                    event changes, sign-up deadlines, drop dates.
                </p>
                <span class="upcsg-card__cue">Open page <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
            </a>

            <a class="upcsg-surface upcsg-lift upcsg-card" href="https://instagram.com/upcsg"
               target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                <span class="upcsg-channel__icon">
                    <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Custom.Brands.Instagram" Size="Size.Medium" />
                </span>
                <span class="upcsg-card__tag">Instagram</span>
                <h3 class="upcsg-card__title">@@upcsg</h3>
                <p class="upcsg-card__meta">
                    Photos from events, merch drops, and the occasional story poll. Drop us a DM
                    if that's easier than a form.
                </p>
                <span class="upcsg-card__cue">Open profile <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
            </a>

            <a class="upcsg-surface upcsg-lift upcsg-card" href="mailto:upcsg.upcebu@gmail.com">
                <span class="upcsg-channel__icon">
                    <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Email" Size="Size.Medium" />
                </span>
                <span class="upcsg-card__tag">Email</span>
                <h3 class="upcsg-card__title upcsg-card__title--mail">upcsg.upcebu@gmail.com</h3>
                <p class="upcsg-card__meta">
                    For anything that needs a paper trail: partnerships, sponsorships, requests
                    from other orgs, and documents.
                </p>
                <span class="upcsg-card__cue">Compose <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    @* ---------- Membership ---------- *@
    <section class="upcsg-section upcsg-split">
        <div class="upcsg-split__body">
            <p class="upcsg-kicker">Joining</p>
            <h2 class="upcsg-title-xl">Become a guilder</h2>
            <p class="upcsg-lede">
                UPCSG is open to every Computer Science major at UP Cebu. Membership drives run at
                the start of each semester and the sign-up form is announced on our socials &mdash;
                so the shortest path in is to follow the Facebook page and watch for it.
            </p>
            <p class="upcsg-lede">
                Missed the drive? Message us anyway. We'd rather point you to the next one than
                have you wait a whole semester wondering.
            </p>

            <dl class="upcsg-contact__facts">
                <div>
                    <dt>Campus</dt>
                    <dd>University of the Philippines Cebu</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <dt>Open to</dt>
                    <dd>All Computer Science majors</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <dt>Drives</dt>
                    <dd>Start of each semester</dd>
                </div>
            </dl>
        </div>

        <div class="upcsg-split__visual">
            <p class="upcsg-split__visual-label">Campus photo &mdash; placeholder</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    @* ---------- FAQ ----------
       Every answer here is something the site already does; nothing invented. *@
    <section class="upcsg-section">
        <div class="upcsg-section-head">
            <div>
                <p class="upcsg-kicker">Before you message</p>
                <h2 class="upcsg-title-xl">Asked a lot</h2>
            </div>
        </div>

        <MudExpansionPanels MultiExpansion="true" Elevation="0" Class="upcsg-faq">
            <MudExpansionPanel Text="Who can join UPCSG?">
                Any Computer Science major at UP Cebu. There's no application beyond the
                membership form, which goes up on our socials at the start of each semester.
            </MudExpansionPanel>

            <MudExpansionPanel Text="How do merch orders work?">
                Add what you want to your cart and check out. You'll then send the GCash
                reference for your payment, an officer verifies it, and the order moves through
                confirmed &rarr; released &rarr; received. You can follow all of that from
                <MudLink Href="orders">My Orders</MudLink>.
            </MudExpansionPanel>

            <MudExpansionPanel Text="Why does the events page only show one month?">
                Because anything further out is still subject to change, and a calendar full of
                dates that later move is worse than no calendar. The current month is the one
                we're confident about.
            </MudExpansionPanel>

            <MudExpansionPanel Text="I won something for the guild and it isn't in the Hall of Fame.">
                Send it our way. We only list achievements the ExeCom can verify, so entries from
                earlier years get added as we confirm them &mdash; nothing is being left out on
                purpose. See <MudLink Href="hall-of-fame">the record</MudLink>.
            </MudExpansionPanel>

            <MudExpansionPanel Text="Can I edit something on this site?">
                Signing in gives you a guilder account, but editing site content is limited to
                executive committee accounts. If something here is wrong, message us and we'll
                fix it.
            </MudExpansionPanel>
        </MudExpansionPanels>
    </section>

    @* ---------- Closing CTA ---------- *@
    <section class="upcsg-section upcsg-band upcsg-cta-band">
        <p class="upcsg-kicker">Still stuck?</p>
        <h2 class="upcsg-title-xl">Just message us</h2>
        <p class="upcsg-lede">
            No question is too small. If you're not sure who to ask, ask us &mdash; we'll route it
            to whoever handles it.
        </p>
        <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Size="Size.Large" Class="upcsg-cta-button px-8"
                   Href="https://facebook.com/upcsg" Target="_blank">
            Message on Facebook
        </MudButton>
    </section>

</div>
